---
import { sourceManifest, taipeiTime } from '../lib/radar';
const synced = taipeiTime(sourceManifest.observed_at);
---
<aside class="radar-grid overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-teal/20 bg-mist p-5 text-sm" aria-label="資料更新狀態">
  <div>
    <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.12em] text-teal">本站判讀的資料依據</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold">資料更新狀態</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-md leading-6 text-ink-soft">這份現況判讀最後一次依據 Forkcast 資料更新的時間與涵蓋範圍。</p>
  </div>
  <dl class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-5 gap-y-3 border-t border-ink/10 pt-4 text-xs">
    <div><dt class="text-ink-soft">原始來源</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">{sourceManifest.source.name}</dd></div>
    <div><dt class="text-ink-soft">資料驗證</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold text-teal">{sourceManifest.validation === 'passed' ? '通過' : sourceManifest.validation}</dd></div>
    <div><dt class="text-ink-soft">最後同步</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">{synced}</dd></div>
    <div><dt class="text-ink-soft">本次快照</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">{sourceManifest.snapshot.eips} 項提案 · {sourceManifest.snapshot.devnets} 個測試網</dd></div>
  </dl>
  <a href="/evidence/" class="mt-5 inline-flex font-semibold text-teal">查看資料來源 →</a>
</aside>
